<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-S.AFRICA A 251-6 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICA A 251-6 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>PIETERMARITZBURG, South Africa 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's A team scored 251-6 from their 50 overs against India in a one-day match on Thursday.</p>
</text>
